# Where the team's KeePassXC vault is on this machine: a setting of your own, never shared.
#
# Copy to `.env.vault` at the repository root and fill it in; it is gitignored. Read only by
# `scripts/secrets/export-to-vault.sh` and `import-from-vault.sh`, which put this repository's secrets files
# (`.env.release`, `.env.testing`) into the vault and bring them back.
#
# Nothing here is a secret: the vault is encrypted, and its master password is typed when the script asks.

# --- The vault -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Provider: KeePassXC (https://keepassxc.org), a .kdbx file shared through the team's synced folder.
# Purpose: the keeper of every secret Agenthix uses, one group per product: this repository's files are the entries of
#   "Agenthix Platform", each file word for word in its entry's Notes.
# Where to get it: the path to the .kdbx in your copy of the synced folder. `~` is allowed.
VAULT_PATH=

# Optional: a key file the vault needs besides its master password. Blank if it has none.
VAULT_KEY_FILE=
